PE 799: Langton's ant II / 兰顿蚂蚁II

=== Standard Langton's Ant ===
Rules: white→turn right→flip to black→move forward
       black→turn left→flip to white→move forward

Key milestones in standard ant behavior:
  ~500 steps: chaotic pseudorandom pattern
  ~10,000 steps: begins building 'highway' (repeating diagonal)
  Highway period: 104 steps, displacing (2,2) each cycle

